# Local configuration, credentials and runtime data never belong in an image.
# Keep the example templates; deploy injects real values at runtime.
**/.env*
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/env
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/.ssh
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/pip.conf
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
